    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE FULL GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Beacon Patrol: First Horizons is a <strong>relaxing</strong> strategy game with endless possiblities.<br><br>Steer your Coast Guard ship and build your own coastal map one tile at a time.<br><br>Get more tiles by exploring and keep building indefinitely as long as you can keep scoring.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554990/extras/71aa59c5ea8b967adc20b739fe7642f1.avif?t=1745867530\" /></span><br>Start with your ship at the Coast Guard HQ and you build your map from there.<br><br>On your turn you place up to three tiles, connecting to the tile your ship currently occupies. Tiles must not be rotated and all their edges have to match.<br><br>After placing a tile you immediately move your ship onto it. By spending one of your tokens you can take an additional movement to a connected tile.<br><br>You score points for each tile that is connected to other tiles on all four sides. For scored points you receive new tiles to continue your journey.<br><br>The game ends after allavaialble tiles have been played.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554990/extras/8c6b05c88d5d9a70a76d53ac585be354.avif?t=1745867530\" /></span><br>Beacon Patrol: First Horizons combines the look and feel of a board game with the endless posibilities of a digital experience.<br><br>Experience this cozy and strategic game at any time.<br><br>The clear and cute art style lets you enjoy the coast and the sea from where ever you are.",
    "about_the_game": "Beacon Patrol: First Horizons is a <strong>relaxing</strong> strategy game with endless possiblities.<br><br>Steer your Coast Guard ship and build your own coastal map one tile at a time.<br><br>Get more tiles by exploring and keep building indefinitely as long as you can keep scoring.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554990/extras/71aa59c5ea8b967adc20b739fe7642f1.avif?t=1745867530\" /></span><br>Start with your ship at the Coast Guard HQ and you build your map from there.<br><br>On your turn you place up to three tiles, connecting to the tile your ship currently occupies. Tiles must not be rotated and all their edges have to match.<br><br>After placing a tile you immediately move your ship onto it. By spending one of your tokens you can take an additional movement to a connected tile.<br><br>You score points for each tile that is connected to other tiles on all four sides. For scored points you receive new tiles to continue your journey.<br><br>The game ends after allavaialble tiles have been played.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554990/extras/8c6b05c88d5d9a70a76d53ac585be354.avif?t=1745867530\" /></span><br>Beacon Patrol: First Horizons combines the look and feel of a board game with the endless posibilities of a digital experience.<br><br>Experience this cozy and strategic game at any time.<br><br>The clear and cute art style lets you enjoy the coast and the sea from where ever you are.",
